# Backend Contracts (DTOs & Interfaces) — Template (Domain-Agnostic)

## Entities (Example)
```csharp
public class EntityDtoModel : FullAuditedEntityDto<Guid>
{
    public string Name { get; set; }
    public string Description { get; set; }
    public DateTime StartAt { get; set; }
    public DateTime EndAt { get; set; }
    public string Location { get; set; }
    public Guid TaxonomyAId { get; set; }
    public Guid TaxonomyBId { get; set; }
}

public class CreateUpdateEntityDto
{
    [Required, StringLength(300)] public string Name { get; set; }
    [Required] public string Description { get; set; }
    [Required] public DateTime StartAt { get; set; }
    [Required] public DateTime EndAt { get; set; }
    [Required, StringLength(400)] public string Location { get; set; }
    [Required] public Guid TaxonomyAId { get; set; }
    [Required] public Guid TaxonomyBId { get; set; }
}

public interface IEntityAppService : ICrudAppService<
    EntityDtoModel, Guid, PagedAndSortedResultRequestDto, CreateUpdateEntityDto>
{
    Task<EntityDtoModel> ApproveAsync(Guid id);
}
```

## Taxonomies (Example — replace with your own)
- TaxonomyA (e.g., Category)
- TaxonomyB (e.g., City/Group)

## Associations/Relations (Example)
```csharp
public class RelationDto : EntityDto<Guid>
{
    public Guid SubjectId { get; set; }
    public Guid ObjectId { get; set; }
    public int State { get; set; } // enum as needed
}

public interface IRelationAppService : IApplicationService
{
    Task CreateAsync(Guid subjectId, Guid objectId);
    Task RemoveAsync(Guid subjectId, Guid objectId);
    Task MarkAsync(Guid relationId, int state);
}
```

